Small relation motifs tracked:
  fold:       a+b=c       coefficient sum 1  -> observer-coupled / translation-sensitive
  midpoint:   a+c=2b      coefficient sum 0  -> balanced but 2-adic midpoint
  collision:  a+b=c+d     coefficient sum 0  -> balanced pair energy
Multiplicand layer: pair-sum denominator C clears nonzero w unless C divides w.

